00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:22.520
"What's your name" I ask.
"Marcus."

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:26.540
"And you work here?" It's clear that he doesn't wanna answer but he gives us a little nod.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:30.080
"We're looking for the rest of our crew, any idea of where they might be?"

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:35.640
"No." he says, curtly, not bothering to elaborate. 
There's got to be some useful information we can get out of this guy.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.720
I just need to know how to dig for it.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:40.820
"I need a first aid kit for my friend here, where might I find one?"

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:43.240
"Down on the second floor, but we can't go down there."

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:46.340
"What's on level 2?" Tell us what's on level 2.

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:51.660
He looks at me like I'm an idiot. "You must be aware that you are in a classified government facility." He says.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:54.100
It makes sense but I wanna doubt it.

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:59.140
"Well, I'm sure the government would want you to help save my friend, so take me to the first aid kit."

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:02.920
"I can't, you don't have clearance. Hell I barely have clearance."

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:06.780
Then, seemingly to himself, he mutters "I make this place run."

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:12.700
"And not even a thank you. Just a bunch of restricted access rooms that I'm not allowed to go into with a freakin' chaperone."

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:16.540
"We're going to that first aid kit." I interrupt.
"I could lose my job!"

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:20.280
I wonder for a moment what sort of trouble I could get into for hitting a government employee.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:21.900
This makes me glad I took it easy on him.

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:27.060
Then again he had come at us with a rifle, it makes me think that things have gone terribly wrong in this place.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:31.300
And the explosion in the woods or what ever the hell happened, might be linked to it all.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:37.520
I need to convince him to take us to the second floor, but I'm not sure if it would be more productive to threaten him or ask for sympathy.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:40.400
