00:19:57.520 --> 00:20:04.080
So maybe threatening him would be the more direct way, but also, once he realizes who we are

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:08.140
and that we are actually saying who we are, threatening him might not be the best option.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:12.860
So we could just literally ask we are in trouble, if this doesn't work then I know he's not gonna work.

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:17.680
"Look, it hasn't been the best day. We're just trying to find out what's going on, to find our crew, to survive."

